{
  "name": "Warrior of the Gods",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A divine entity helps ensure you can continue the fight. You have a pool of four d12s that you can spend to heal yourself. As a Bonus Action, you can expend dice from the pool, roll them, and regain a number of Hit Points equal to the roll's total.</p><p>Your pool regains one die when you finish a Short Rest, and all expended dice when you finish a Long Rest.</p><p>The pool's maximum number of dice increases by one when you reach Barbarian levels 6 (5 dice), 12 (6 dice), and 17 (7 dice).</p>",
